# Local secrets. Secrets live in the customer's vault, never in the repo or image.
# (Dev credentials use `dotnet user-secrets`, stored OUTSIDE the repo in ~/.microsoft/usersecrets/ —
#  nothing to ignore. Properties/launchSettings.json is tracked deliberately: it holds no secrets,
#  only the Development environment + port that make user-secrets load.)
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
secrets.json
.env
*.pfx
*.key
